  <JobName.captain_arcane>星图舰长</JobName.captain_arcane>
  <JobDescription.captain_arcane>把星图当航海图，把命运当洋流。保留舰长天赋树，并拥有额外的星航分支。</JobDescription.captain_arcane>
  <JobName.captain_mystic>深渊船长</JobName.captain_mystic>
  <JobDescription.captain_mystic>深海会回应每一个名字，只要你付得起代价。保留舰长天赋树，并拥有额外的深渊分支。</JobDescription.captain_mystic>
